map $effective_status $error_message_final {

    # --- 1xx ---
    100 "The server has received your request and is currently dusting off its processing gears. Please hold while it prepares for the next exciting step of this HTTP journey.";
    101 "The server agrees to switch protocols. It is now putting on a different hat and adjusting its tie to speak the protocol you requested.";
    102 "Processing has begun — the server is juggling tasks, flipping bits, and consulting its internal librarians. Progress is happening, even if the results aren't quite ready to show off.";
    103 "Early hints are being sent. The server would like you to know it's working very hard and hopes this preview sparks joy.";

    # --- 2xx ---
    200 "Success! Everything worked perfectly. The server smiled, handed over your requested resource, and hopes you appreciate its impeccable service.";
    201 "Your resource has been created. It now exists proudly in the digital landscape, freshly constructed and ready for further adventures.";
    202 "Your request has been accepted for processing, but the results are still brewing somewhere in the background. The server promises it’s on the case.";
    203 "Non-authoritative information returned. The server retrieved the data, but it came from an outside source whose reliability may or may not involve optimism.";
    204 "Success — with absolutely nothing to return. The server completed your request silently and respectfully, like a ninja delivering results without leaving evidence.";
    205 "The server successfully processed your request and politely suggests that your user agent reset its view. A gentle tap on the refresh button of life.";
    206 "Partial content delivered. The server sent the portion you asked for and assumes you know what you're doing, even if it's downloading a file piece by piece like it's 1999.";
    207 "Multi-status response. The server is handing you a small report card summarizing a variety of outcomes — some good, some questionable, all accounted for.";
    208 "Already reported. The server already mentioned this resource, so it's not repeating itself. Efficiency is key.";
    226 "IM Used. The server applied a cool transformation and is pleased to present data that may now be slightly more optimized or magical.";

    # --- 3xx ---
    300 "Multiple choices available. The server presents you with a small buffet of possibilities and encourages you to follow your heart.";
    301 "This resource has permanently moved. The server advises updating your bookmarks, forwarding addresses, and maybe notifying relatives.";
    302 "This resource has temporarily moved. The server promises it will be back at its old place soon — probably — but for now, it’s over *there*.";
    303 "See Other. The server wants you to look at a different resource instead, like a polite librarian redirecting you to the correct bookshelf.";
    304 "Not modified. The server checked thoroughly and concluded nothing has changed since last time. Why send it again? Efficiency is beauty.";
    305 "Use Proxy. The server kindly instructs you to go through a proxy, as if it's pointing you toward a friend who ‘knows a guy’.";
    306 "Unused. This code once had purpose, ambition, and dreams — but now it has retired into legend. The server salutes it.";
    307 "Temporary redirect. The server insists you repeat the exact same method at the new location. Consistency matters.";
    308 "Permanent redirect. The server announces the move is final and encourages you to update everything accordingly, including old bookmarks buried deep in forgotten browser settings.";

    # --- 4xx ---
    400 "Your request was malformed or incomplete. It arrived like a jigsaw puzzle with half the pieces missing, the instructions written in a forgotten language, and a note saying 'good luck'. The server tried to make sense of it but eventually gave up for the sake of its own sanity.";
    401 "Authentication is required. To proceed, you must provide credentials, tokens, passwords, keycards, or possibly a magic incantation. Without proper identification, the server is reluctant to let strangers wander its corridors.";
    402 "Payment is required to access this resource. Unfortunately, the server currently accepts only rare digital artifacts such as cookies, session tokens, and possibly the tears of developers debugging production systems. Monetary payments are temporarily unavailable.";
